Subject: Keep rsync test prerequisites portable across native Python builds
Origin: Peios packaging, test-only portability adaptation

Use os.chroot, defer Darwin-only ctypes imports, and use a compiled fallocate
probe with identical allocation checks. Preserve comma-only username checks
when no POSIX account exists; report the group-rule coverage as unavailable.

